{"vid":"7xa1etm6X6c","source":"7xa1etm6X6c.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":1.5,"txt":"Hey, welcome to the shop. So, over the"},{"t":3.2,"txt":"10 years I've been making videos, my"},{"t":5.1,"txt":"little workshop has evolved a lot, but"},{"t":7,"txt":"one thing I've always wanted in here is"},{"t":9.4,"txt":"an American flag."},{"t":11.4,"txt":"I never purchased one because I've had"},{"t":13,"txt":"this idea in my head for a fabricated"},{"t":15.4,"txt":"steel flag for a long time, and what"},{"t":18.2,"txt":"better time to build one than today,"},{"t":20.9,"txt":"which is the United States of America's"},{"t":22.6,"txt":"250th anniversary. I'm building this out"},{"t":25.8,"txt":"of inch and a half by half-inch"},{"t":27.4,"txt":"rectangular tubing, and I'm going to"},{"t":29,"txt":"start off by building a frame around the"},{"t":31,"txt":"outside. Now, to figure out the"},{"t":32.7,"txt":"dimensions, I found this flag calculator"},{"t":34.8,"txt":"online, which is really cool. It just"},{"t":37.1,"txt":"put everything in based on the width of"},{"t":38.8,"txt":"the stripes. And so, then I could lay"},{"t":41.5,"txt":"out my main frame around the outside,"},{"t":44.2,"txt":"and I'm building a little fixture here"},{"t":45.7,"txt":"on the Sigman table. Now, you could just"},{"t":48,"txt":"tack things together and bump them"},{"t":49.5,"txt":"around on a regular table, and that'd be"},{"t":51.1,"txt":"fine, but this can be a huge time-saver"},{"t":53,"txt":"just to hold everything in place while"},{"t":55,"txt":"you weld it out."},{"t":56.8,"txt":"Getting the whole thing square and"},{"t":58.1,"txt":"accurate is going to be really helpful"},{"t":60,"txt":"when I start filling it in with the"},{"t":61.2,"txt":"stars and stripes. I'm building the"},{"t":62.7,"txt":"whole thing upside down. So, I used a"},{"t":65.4,"txt":"few drops from my cuts to be able to"},{"t":68.2,"txt":"space this back into the center of the"},{"t":70.4,"txt":"frame, and I had to put a little chamfer"},{"t":73.2,"txt":"on the edge to clear that fillet weld so"},{"t":75.2,"txt":"it would sit right down at the bottom"},{"t":77.1,"txt":"with that first stripe, and then I"},{"t":78.7,"txt":"tacked it in place."},{"t":80.7,"txt":"I'm going to then work my way up with"},{"t":82.7,"txt":"some more drops as spacers just to lay"},{"t":85.9,"txt":"each part in right here, and I'm just"},{"t":88.1,"txt":"putting a few tacks on each side on the"},{"t":90.1,"txt":"back, and I'm not going to tack it or"},{"t":92.7,"txt":"weld it all on the front, and so my"},{"t":95.3,"txt":"spacing is really important, right? Make"},{"t":97.6,"txt":"sure everything is cut just right."},{"t":100.4,"txt":"So, once I have those bottom three in"},{"t":102.9,"txt":"place, I need to start looking at the"},{"t":105.2,"txt":"union, and rather than uploading"},{"t":107.8,"txt":"something, I figured I'd try"},{"t":109,"txt":"SendCutSend's new"},{"t":111,"txt":"AI feature. And so, I just typed in what"},{"t":113.7,"txt":"I wanted here, and I didn't know how"},{"t":116.3,"txt":"well it would be able to handle this"},{"t":117.6,"txt":"task, but uh I was really surprised at"},{"t":120.6,"txt":"the results. So, um this is just crazy"},{"t":122.9,"txt":"to me. You can type in just some kind of"},{"t":125.2,"txt":"a prompt and it'll come out with"},{"t":126.6,"txt":"something so good that I can put in just"},{"t":129,"txt":"a couple more clicks. I ordered it out"},{"t":131,"txt":"of stainless steel to give a little bit"},{"t":132.5,"txt":"of a contrasting color, and there's a"},{"t":134,"txt":"lot of ways that I could have made these"},{"t":135.4,"txt":"parts, but uh I didn't have the material"},{"t":137.5,"txt":"in stock and really buying a small"},{"t":139.6,"txt":"quantity of the material is about the"},{"t":140.9,"txt":"same as getting the whole part here, and"},{"t":143.1,"txt":"I only spent a couple of minutes on the"},{"t":144.7,"txt":"design and ordering it. So, it's really"},{"t":146.6,"txt":"cool. Now, my intention was to use heat"},{"t":150.5,"txt":"to color that stainless steel blue,"},{"t":153.5,"txt":"and then to uh produce a red patina."},{"t":156.3,"txt":"But, on the test parts that I ran, it"},{"t":158.6,"txt":"didn't come out very good, or at least"},{"t":160.2,"txt":"it only looked good from a certain"},{"t":161.5,"txt":"angle. So, I decided to leave everything"},{"t":163.1,"txt":"just raw metal."},{"t":164.6,"txt":"So, I've tacked that union in place"},{"t":166.8,"txt":"there, and I can work my way down in the"},{"t":169.4,"txt":"same way that I worked my way up with"},{"t":171.6,"txt":"these other stripes. And it's just super"},{"t":175.3,"txt":"important to cut everything really"},{"t":176.6,"txt":"accurately, and I'm not trying to make"},{"t":178.2,"txt":"this a a commercial for chop saws, but"},{"t":180.7,"txt":"I'll tell you that Evolution saw, it"},{"t":182.6,"txt":"really makes this uh super easy to get"},{"t":186,"txt":"those cuts just right and to fit"},{"t":188,"txt":"perfectly."},{"t":189.2,"txt":"So, with that in place, I can weld"},{"t":191.6,"txt":"everything. I'll put a few extra welds"},{"t":194,"txt":"along the top, and then a little bar"},{"t":196.5,"txt":"behind the union here to support it."},{"t":198.9,"txt":"This is just some 1/2-in square tubing"},{"t":200.7,"txt":"that I had laying around, and we'll flip"},{"t":202.8,"txt":"it over and take a look at it."},{"t":205.4,"txt":"I'm really excited about how this turned"},{"t":207.5,"txt":"out. I think it's going to look really"},{"t":208.5,"txt":"cool with the uh gray walls and things"},{"t":211.4,"txt":"that I have."},{"t":212.7,"txt":"Now, I'm going to clean up just a few"},{"t":214.6,"txt":"little spots on the corner that were"},{"t":216.7,"txt":"protruding from those welds, and then"},{"t":219.1,"txt":"I'm going to weld on the back side a"},{"t":221,"txt":"couple pieces of scrap angle iron that I"},{"t":223.2,"txt":"had that'll act as a hook that I can"},{"t":225.3,"txt":"hang it on some screws, and then I'll go"},{"t":227.5,"txt":"ahead and put it up uh right there high"},{"t":230.5,"txt":"in the shop where I can see it and uh"},{"t":232.6,"txt":"remember the country that allows the"},{"t":234.5,"txt":"freedoms that I enjoy every day. I'm"},{"t":237.1,"txt":"really happy with how it turned out. If"},{"t":238.6,"txt":"you enjoyed this and learned something,"},{"t":239.9,"txt":"let me know by hitting that thumbs up"},{"t":241.2,"txt":"below. And I hope you have just an"},{"t":243.8,"txt":"awesome day today. Thanks for tuning in."},{"t":246,"txt":"We'll see you next time."}],"words":[{"t":1.52,"w":"Hey,"},{"t":1.76,"w":"welcome"},{"t":2.04,"w":"to"},{"t":2.12,"w":"the"},{"t":2.2,"w":"shop."},{"t":2.6,"w":"So,"},{"t":2.8,"w":"over"},{"t":3.04,"w":"the"},{"t":3.16,"w":"10"},{"t":3.44,"w":"years"},{"t":3.68,"w":"I've"},{"t":3.8,"w":"been"},{"t":4,"w":"making"},{"t":4.4,"w":"videos,"},{"t":4.96,"w":"my"},{"t":5.12,"w":"little"},{"t":5.36,"w":"workshop"},{"t":5.84,"w":"has"},{"t":5.96,"w":"evolved"},{"t":6.36,"w":"a"},{"t":6.44,"w":"lot,"},{"t":6.84,"w":"but"},{"t":7.04,"w":"one"},{"t":7.28,"w":"thing"},{"t":7.48,"w":"I've"},{"t":7.68,"w":"always"},{"t":8.04,"w":"wanted"},{"t":8.4,"w":"in"},{"t":8.56,"w":"here"},{"t":9,"w":"is"},{"t":9.4,"w":"an"},{"t":9.52,"w":"American"},{"t":10.04,"w":"flag."},{"t":11.36,"w":"I"},{"t":11.44,"w":"never"},{"t":11.72,"w":"purchased"},{"t":12.24,"w":"one"},{"t":12.44,"w":"because"},{"t":12.68,"w":"I've"},{"t":12.8,"w":"had"},{"t":12.96,"w":"this"},{"t":13.16,"w":"idea"},{"t":13.44,"w":"in"},{"t":13.56,"w":"my"},{"t":13.72,"w":"head"},{"t":14.16,"w":"for"},{"t":14.6,"w":"a"},{"t":14.68,"w":"fabricated"},{"t":15.4,"w":"steel"},{"t":15.84,"w":"flag"},{"t":16.36,"w":"for"},{"t":16.64,"w":"a"},{"t":16.68,"w":"long"},{"t":17,"w":"time,"},{"t":17.52,"w":"and"},{"t":17.96,"w":"what"},{"t":18.16,"w":"better"},{"t":18.4,"w":"time"},{"t":18.92,"w":"to"},{"t":19.28,"w":"build"},{"t":19.64,"w":"one"},{"t":20,"